cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "timeline: annotated timeline charts from JSON with an overlap-free layout"
abstract: >-
  A small Python tool that draws annotated timeline charts from a JSON file:
  a time axis, one label per event and an optional list of notes. Label
  placement is optimised so that texts never overlap and connectors never
  cross labels; the figure size adapts to the content and the final drawing
  is checked automatically. Output in PNG, PDF or SVG via matplotlib.
